{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Saturday, the ridge above the reservoir"}]},
{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Left the car at the gate a little after seven. The path climbs through birch for the first half hour, then breaks out onto open ground below the two tops."}]},
